# Seeded with the Lamplight fixture. A verb offers every thing on the page,
# not only those among its first few words: opening the crate reveals the
# note under the room description, and Read should offer it.
wait-for Lamplight
tap Lamplight
wait-for light.
tap Open
wait-for Open what?
tap Wooden crate
wait-for revealing a folded note.
expect pool of light.
tap Read
wait-for Read what?
clean
shot objects-read-what
tap Folded note
wait-for A note folded small
